m, providing them with divine Blood, and the city has thrived since then. Those who consume New Blood are healed of all injuries, and those who consume Old Blood are cured of all diseases. People from all over the world regularly flock to the city to experience these miracles. But, to many Yharnamites, life is dirty, miserable, and cramped. That was life for the young Andrew Graves and his family for the longest time, until one day he came across a new kind of blood - \"Pale Blood\" - and he is forced suddenly and unexpectedly into the world of Hunters.","i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/62f38c70-1772-4791-a80e-e91a0948c84d.png"],"nt":"story","rInput":"medium","rInteract":"medium","spoilerTags":["incest"],"storyStatus":"active","t":"Yharnam: World of Horror","ta":["smut","horror","bloodandgore","harem","sex","bloodborne","worldofhorror","tcoaal","almostnopermadeath","cyoa","impregnation","monsterfucking","furry","teratophilia","xenophilia","yuri","incest"],"u":[{"_id":"N5Zk4n6ZnKQdgKriC","n":"occultism101"}],"p":4955,"w":52197,"likeCount":45,"hype":0,"ct":1791677374999,"ut":1793461748258,"cht":1793418619412,"isLive":false,"canonicalTags":["smut","horror","bloodandgore","harem","bloodborne","worldofhorror","tcoaal","almostnopermadeath","cyoa","impregnation","monsterfucking","furry","teratophilia","xenophilia","yuri","incest"]},{"_id":"hLxrsjYJ5iFdJQY7K","contentRating":"nsfw","d":"Welp, looks like the Teen Titans are back around, only this reboot is less comedic, and a lot more focused on sexy side of things.","i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/e73697d2-9d95-4425-b1ed-6eda181273ae.jpg"],"nsfwCover":true,"nt":"story","rInput":"light","rInteract":"light","spoilerTags":[],"storyStatus":"hiatus","t":"Titans: A Lewd Reboot","ta":["corruption","mindbreak","teentitans","smut","futa"],"u":[{"_id":"wuQs5PPnpvxoczJX9","n":"kenjiyoi"}],"p":1388,"w":30830,"likeCount":72,"hype":0,"ct":1720468687172,"ut":1793461747812,"cht":1741129958432,"isLive":false